<title>FRANCE: French ADP postal traffic up in Nov 96 and Jan-Nov.</title>
<headline>French ADP postal traffic up in Nov 96 and Jan-Nov.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Postal traffic handled at the Paris airports, Charles de Gaulle and Orly, in November 1996 totalled 10,614 tonnes, up 8.1 percent on the same period 1995, airport authority figures show.</p>
<p>January-November 1996 postal traffic handled at the two Paris airports totalled 116,848 tonnes, an increase of 4.1 percent on the same period the previous year. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
